<h2 id=3D"AccessControl:CompassLegacy-CompassLegacyFeatures"><strong>Compas=
s Legacy Features</strong></h2>
<p><a href=3D"/spaces/NWPI/pages/1353762177/Firm+Feature+Packages#FirmFeatu=
rePackages-Managefeatures">Firm Feature Packages#Managefeatures</a></p>
<p>Features represent the units of value within the platform, expressed fro=
m the perspective of the buyers of firms. Features can represent any produc=
t or service that &nbsp;is being offered to the firm when they decide to bu=
y or upgrade to compass x.</p>
<p>These features can be associated with digital features or services and c=
an be used to monitor/manage access to feature versions and usage levels.</=
p>
<p><br></p>
