<h2 id=3D"AccessControl:CompassLegacy-FeaturePackages"><strong>Feature Pack=
ages</strong></h2>
<p><a href=3D"/spaces/NWPI/pages/1353762177/Firm+Feature+Packages#FirmFeatu=
rePackages-Managefeaturepackages">Firm Feature Packages#Managefeaturepackag=
es</a></p>
<p>Feature packages standardize the offerings across firms and simplifies f=
irm onboarding. It also simplifies development and testing by limiting the =
test cases.</p>
