<h2 id=3D"AccessControl:CompassLegacy-UserGroups"><strong>User Groups</stro=
ng></h2>
<p>Ability to organize the groups within all firms.</p>
<p>The below illustration depicts the groups in a typical IB and PM firm.</=
p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"299" src=3D"2d3a13b00765b9e0da23d98b93e3d3d53662173810e58364da669b8bf1=
160b2a" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/1564117363/Screenshot%20202=
3-03-06%20at%201.22.50%20PM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D16901586=
31649&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resourc=
e-id=3D"1564122927" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource=
-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2023-=
03-06 at 1.22.50 PM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-=
resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"15=
