<h4 id=3D"AccessControl:CompassLegacy-CompassUserRoles">Compass User Roles<=
/h4>
<p>Since there are a wide variety of variations in firm setups across the c=
lient base, external user feature access will be assigned based on capabili=
ties rather than job function.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Details of the user groups being setup can be found here: <a href=3D"htt=
ps://wiki.bnc.ca/display/NWPI/Access+Control+-+Setup?src=3Dcontextnavpagetr=
eemode" rel=3D"nofollow" style=3D"text-align: left;">Access Control - Setup=
</a></p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p>The following outlines the desired user feature assignment model:</p>
