<p><span>*All - Profile, Servicing, Trades, Transactions, Accounts</span></=
p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<h2 id=3D"AccessControl:CompassLegacy-InteractionbetweenFirmandUserFeatures=
"><strong>Interaction between Firm and User Features</strong></h2>
<p>At the time of assigning user groups to users, there may be some restric=
tions on what user groups are available for selection, or if the firm featu=
re bundle has been modified, what user functions remain on users of that fi=
rm.</p>
<p><strong>Use Cases</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li>Firm Feature Removed=20
  <ul>
   <li>User features should be assigned as a subset of the firm features. I=
f firm features are removes, the associated user features should also be re=
moved.&nbsp;</li>
  </ul></li>
 <li>New Feature introduced=20
  <ul>
   <li>Features added will need to be added to assigned feature packages an=
d standard user features to take full effect</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>User Assignment</strong></p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper"><img class=3D"confluenc=
e-embedded-image confluence-external-resource" draggable=3D"false" src=3D"h=
ttps://wiki.bnc.ca/download/attachments/1466913822/image-2023-4-24_10-1-13.=
png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1682344873448&amp;api=3Dv2" data-ima=
ge-src=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/download/attachments/1466913822/image-2023-4-=
24_10-1-13.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1682344873448&amp;api=3Dv=
2"></span></p>
<h2 id=3D"AccessControl:CompassLegacy-ImplementingAccessControl-(CompassLeg=
acy)"><span>Implementing Access Control - (Compass Legacy)</span></h2>
<p>Since this is an integration, implementing access control for this featu=
re includes:</p>
<ul>
 <li>Controlling the access to the module on the platform</li>
 <li>Controlling the behaviour within the integrated module</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Module Access Control</strong></p>
<p>Implementation: <strong> <span class=3D"jira-issue" data-jira-key=3D"NWP=
I-8973" data-client-id=3D"SINGLE_6770dc6c-0646-39a6-a1ea-561a14a12e2f_15641=
17363_8ab247629ffb6d5c01a0066f1fcb0034"> <a href=3D"https://jira.bnc.ca/bro=
wse/NWPI-8973" class=3D"jira-issue-key"><span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-wa=
it issue-placeholder"></span>NWPI-8973</a> - <span class=3D"summary">Gettin=
g issue details...</span> <span class=3D"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui=
-lozenge-default issue-placeholder">STATUS</span> </span> </strong></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 98=
.1381%;letter-spacing: 0.0px;">
